feat(profile): optional social-media links (Instagram/Facebook/TikTok/website) + reword redundant line

Social links (URLs only — no storage cost), additive to "casos de éxito" photos:
- DB migration 056: professionals.social_links jsonb (apply in Supabase).
- Profile editor: new "Redes sociales" section with Instagram/Facebook/TikTok/Sitio
  web inputs (optional). Values are normalized to full URLs (accepts full link,
  domain/path, or bare @handle/username) and saved best-effort in their own update
  (non-fatal if the column isn't migrated). Only filled-in links are stored.
- Public profile: a clean row of recognizable social icons (only the ones set),
  opening the pro's page in a new tab. casos de éxito photo uploads unchanged.
- Custom brand icons (social-icons.tsx) since lucide no longer ships Instagram/
  Facebook; website uses lucide Globe; query exposes socialLinks (best-effort).
- Text: "Fotos de trabajos anteriores, reseñas de clientes reales y cédula
  verificada." -> "Casos de éxito, reseñas de clientes reales y cédula verificada."
  (EN "Success stories, real client reviews, and verified ID.") — non-redundant.

